外部资源，推动联调、过检、产线等环节的流程标准化和效率提升；积极探索AI工具在日常工作中的应用，提升整体工作效能。","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，计算机、通信工程、车辆工程、信息管理等相关专业。\n2.有车联网或汽车行业IT从业经验，其中含TSP平台运营/架构/技术管理经验；熟悉车型的TSP平台联调、过检及量产上线全流程。\n3.深入掌握TSP平台整体架构（车端T-Box/网关、云平台、APP端、第三方生态），具备端到端链路调优和架构演进规划能力；熟悉新能源车型国家法规检测要求，具备过检联调、产线EOL检测与批量刷写支持经验。\n4.有丰富的线上重大故障应急处置经验，能快速拉通多团队完成故障定位、止损与恢复；能建立故障分级响应机制、应急预案及复盘体系；具备数据分析能力，能独立开展平台运行数据统计与分析，通过数据驱动识别问题根因，持续优化平台稳定性和运行效率。\n5.逻辑思维突出，善于系统性分析和根因挖掘；具备平台Owner意识，擅长跨团队协同推动、多任务统筹；抗压能力强，有良好的文档撰写和汇报能力；熟悉市面上主流AI产品及工具，有实际应用经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":"软件研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-24T15:36:28","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"e53b3c6d-b664-46fe-bc2f-5ba5b33b5359","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561325910,"PostDateInt":1795162515000,"PostDate":"2026-11-20T16:15:15","EndTimeInt